{"id":"01802560a40eec95","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-modular-term-rank.md","title":"混合项的层数与主要子项","display":"df-modular-term-rank — 混合项的层数与主要子项","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-modular-term-rank","aliases":["56-df-modular-term-rank"],"display":"df-modular-term-rank — 混合项的层数与主要子项","depends_on":["[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_section":"§5.7.1 Definition 5.7.3","source_printed_pages":"164–165","source_ocr_blocks":[185,186],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-modular-term-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-modular-term-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modular-term-rank — 混合项的层数与主要子项"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.7.1 Definition 5.7.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"164–165"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span><span>186</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a> 的不交签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)\">\\(\\Sigma_i=(F_i,a_i)\\)</span>、并签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 和项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。位置、前缀序、子项与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{root}\">\\(\\operatorname{root}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_0\\cup F_1\">\\(f\\in F_0\\cup F_1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=(a_0\\cup a_1)(f)\">\\(k=(a_0\\cup a_1)(f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T\">\\(t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi:F_0\\cup F_1\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi(f)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;f\\in F_0,\\\\1&amp;f\\in F_1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi:F_0\\cup F_1\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi(f)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;f\\in F_0,\\\\1&amp;f\\in F_1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_i:T\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad h_i(x)\\coloneqq0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_i:T\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad h_i(x)\\coloneqq0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_i(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq|\\{i\\}\\setminus\\{\\chi(f)\\}|+\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{h_{\\chi(f)}(t_j):1\\le j\\le k\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_i(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq|\\{i\\}\\setminus\\{\\chi(f)\\}|+\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{h_{\\chi(f)}(t_j):1\\le j\\le k\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}:T\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\\operatorname{rank}(x)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rank}:T\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0},\\qquad\\operatorname{rank}(x)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{h_{\\chi(f)}(t_j):1\\le j\\le k\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rank}(f(t_1,\\ldots,t_k))\\coloneqq1+\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{h_{\\chi(f)}(t_j):1\\le j\\le k\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrincipalPos}:T\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrincipalPos}:T\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrincipalPos}(x)\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrincipalPos}(x)\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{PrincipalPos}(t)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):{}&amp;\\epsilon\\prec p,\\;t|_p\\notin V,\\;\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t|_p))\\ne\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall q\\in\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):u\\prec p\\}\\;(\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t|_q))=\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t)))\\}\\quad(t\\in T\\setminus V).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{PrincipalPos}(t)\\coloneqq\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):{}&amp;\\epsilon\\prec p,\\;t|_p\\notin V,\\;\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t|_p))\\ne\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall q\\in\\{u\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):u\\prec p\\}\\;(\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t|_q))=\\chi(\\operatorname{root}(t)))\\}\\quad(t\\in T\\setminus V).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>hᵢ 从给定父颜色开始统计一条向下路径上的最多颜色变化；项的层数等于一加最多颜色变化数。递归只调用严格子项，空参数列的 max 包含 0，变量约定 rank=1 与原书的单色项约定一致。PrincipalPos 选择自根向下首次换色的位置，保留同一子项的不同出现；其严格前缀一定是合法的非变量位置，root 的调用都有定义。这是原书多孔单色前缀描述的等价位置式，没有借 Remark 补定义。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":fa